cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference Simic, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Simic: Counterfactual Generative Morphogenesis"
abstract: >-
  A lifecycle-driven neural training system in which new computational
  structure is generated from the live state of a host network, then
  conformed, compiled, QA-tested in matched counterfactual branches,
  adjudicated against doing nothing, embodied reversibly under warrant,
  and eventually retired.
authors:
  - family-names: Morrissey
    given-names: John
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/tachyon-beep/simic"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - neural-architecture-growth
  - morphogenesis
  - counterfactual-evaluation
  - lifecycle-driven-training
